      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am getting this issue with Particle Systems too on my Quest avatar builds.  I used an additive VRC Mobile Particle shader and then used the labs icon \"CL_Lab_Icon_256\" for the texture.  Looks fine in unity with the transparency around the icon.  In game, the particles emitted turn into purple colored squares.  Similar things happen to my Trail Renders, where when using the same shader it just turns into a dark purple line.  Not sure if its intended to not have transparency at all in the first place, but I want to comment about it anyways",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
